    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27074" root="طمح" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَمُوحُ البَصَرِ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَامِحٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحْرٌ طَمُوحُ المَوْجِ</span>
(A, TA) (tropical:)  <i>A sea of which the waves rise high.</i>
(TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِئْرٌ طَمُوحُ المَآءِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A well of which the
water has collected and risen high.</i> (TA.)

